0..75 Comment "//! Calls nested inside a path type\'s endpoints convert to their values. An"
76..152 Comment "//! endpoint that applies a function to another call waits on the inner call"
153..230 Comment "//! once the outer one unfolds, and conversion unfolds that call next; over a"
231..306 Comment "//! presented type the inner call stands under a constructor the outer call"
307..385 Comment "//! built, and the normal form reads it before the rules run. An endpoint that"
386..466 Comment "//! applies the function a call returns is the bind over that call applying what"
467..531 Comment "//! it binds. Conversion is definitional equality by computation"
532..580 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]."
581..584 Comment "//!"
585..645 Comment "//! - see: #2326 — `bound_is_applied`, `outside_is_inside`"
646..702 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
703..706 Comment "//!"
707..879 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]: https://archive-pml.github.io/martin-lof/pdfs/Bibliopolis-Book-retypeset-1984.pdf \"Martin-Löf, Intuitionistic Type Theory\""
